iption": "Space Tag is a fast-paced multiplayer experience inspired by the movement and chaos of Gorilla Tag, reimagined in a vast zero-gravity universe. Players launch themselves across futuristic space environments using skill-based movement, momentum, and precise control to chase, escape, and outplay opponents in intense rounds of cosmic tag.\n\nMaster unique movement mechanics as you bounce, glide, and propel yourself through floating platforms, asteroid fields, space stations, and neon-lit arenas designed to reward creativity and quick thinking. Every match tests your reflexes, positioning, and strategy as you adapt to unpredictable player movement in a fully three-dimensional environment.\n\nWhether you\u2019re evading pursuers, coordinating with friends, or perfecting advanced movement techniques, Space Tag delivers nonstop action where skill matters more than luck. Explore immersive maps, compete against players from around the world, and improve your movement mastery as you climb the skill curve.\n\nWith smooth gameplay, competitive energy, and endless replayability, Space Tag offers a unique social and action-packed experience where every jump, turn, and decision can mean the difference between escape and capture. Enter the arena, defy gravity, and prove you have what it takes to become the ultimate space runner.", "short_description": "A fast-paced space tag game inspired by Gorilla Tag, featuring zero-gravity movement, intense chases, and skill-based parkour. Outmaneuver opponents, explore cosmic arenas, and test your reflexes in nonstop multiplayer action."}]}, "developer_name": "SPACETAG", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ng3TCpMidC5HjPfepowKin3qXpshLx6Aru2nRNVn3Xs/edit?usp=drivesdk", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SPACETAG", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1YvBeDCOAxY3Ukgp5sxFRsGwJmgW8CKttQcPLFObJTxM/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "com